+	 * strided array of per-vector control blocks (mask, coalescing
+	 * timer, credit return) that the data-path IRQs occupy in BAR0.
+	 * vnic_intr_alloc() defaults to RES_TYPE_INTR_CTRL, which is what
+	 * we want here.
